WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.115
(logo whooshes)

00:00:01.115 --> 00:00:03.782
(metal squeaks)

00:00:05.242 --> 00:00:06.809
- [Narrator] I'm drinking at this party,

00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:08.992
maybe four shots deep.

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:11.848
You ask if you can borrow $5 from me.

00:00:11.848 --> 00:00:14.106
At this point, I'm drunk.

00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:16.023
I don't say yes, or no,

00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:19.290
I don't say anything at all.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.985
If you take $5 from me,

00:00:20.985 --> 00:00:23.330
even if I didn't explicitly say no,

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.594
you stole from me.

00:00:25.594 --> 00:00:27.510
We're standing in line for the bathroom.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.843
I ask you to hold my purse while I go in.

00:00:29.843 --> 00:00:32.200
If you take $5 from my purse,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.511
even though I trusted you to hold it,

00:00:34.511 --> 00:00:36.670
you stole from me.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.145
I'm on a dark street.

00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:40.130
I feel a gun on the back of my head.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.382
You ask me for $5 again.

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:45.773
Even if I physically
handed those $5 to you,

00:00:45.773 --> 00:00:47.273
you stole from me.

00:00:50.402 --> 00:00:53.896
We're out to breakfast and
you're short $5 for a coffee.

00:00:53.896 --> 00:00:55.937
I lend it to you because we're friends,

00:00:55.937 --> 00:00:58.017
and because you asked me.

00:00:58.017 --> 00:01:00.316
The table next to us is short on cash too,

00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:02.487
and they saw me lend you money.

00:01:02.487 --> 00:01:03.636
If they go into my purse,

00:01:03.636 --> 00:01:06.771
and assume they can have
$5, as well, without asking,

00:01:06.771 --> 00:01:08.354
they stole from me.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.495
I couple weeks later, you
ask to borrow $5 again.

00:01:12.495 --> 00:01:15.795
This time, I don't wanna give it to you.

00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:17.462
This time, I say no.

00:01:18.973 --> 00:01:21.771
Just because I let you borrow $5 before,

00:01:21.771 --> 00:01:24.836
that doesn't mean you can
take it whenever you want.

00:01:24.836 --> 00:01:26.972
If you take it without asking,

00:01:26.972 --> 00:01:28.472
you stole from me.

00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:35.601
If you steal $5 from me, but
I cant' prove it in court,

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:38.339
you still stole from me.

00:01:38.339 --> 00:01:39.778
Whatever the scenario,

00:01:39.778 --> 00:01:43.157
you cannot take $5 from
me without my permission.

00:01:43.157 --> 00:01:44.271
That's stealing.

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:45.502
Whatever the scenario,

00:01:45.502 --> 00:01:48.219
you can't take my body without permission.

00:01:48.219 --> 00:01:50.030
That's rape.

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:51.640
Consent is simple.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.640
(slow mellow music)

